# Machines (step 4 part 1): each scene builds its machines from Awakened granite with no player,
# fills their network, makes them work once and reports. The Motor starts first and is checked
# a few commands later, once its mechanical network has spun up; then its crystal rests and,
# a few commands after that, the quern must have stopped. Step 4 part 2's Dead Socket Motor follows
# the same pattern; its other scenes run after Quicken.
